Error [jet.ValueTypeMismatch]: `show` wants Int (a whole number) for argument 1, but this is String (text)
  --> Tests/UI/arg_type_mismatch.jet:3:18
    |
  3 | run: fn() { show("hi") }
    |                  ^^^^
